# UI components

Full spec: `DESIGN.md` (load only for visual/design work).

## Tailwind tokens (summary)

- Surfaces: `bg-surface`, `bg-surface-hover`, `border-border`
- Text: `text-foreground`, `text-muted-foreground`, `text-accent`
- Chinese text: `hanzi-lg`, `hanzi-xl` utility classes
- Accent: warm gold/amber theme — use `text-accent`, `border-accent`, `hover:text-accent`

## Patterns

- Functional components; extract hooks for reusable client logic
- Vietnamese UI copy for user-facing strings
- Use existing components in `src/components/ui/` before adding new primitives
- App Router: `'use client'` only when needed (state, effects, browser APIs)

## Do not

- Paste full `DESIGN.md` into changes — reference token names only
- Add inline styles when Tailwind utilities exist in the codebase
